msgstr "Ryd gemt API-nøgle"

#: admin.py:168
msgid ""
"A key is stored encrypted. Leave blank to keep it, or enter a new key to "
"replace it. The stored value cannot be viewed."
msgstr ""
"Der gemmes en krypteret nøgle. Lad feltet være tomt for at beholde den, "
"eller indtast en ny nøgle for at erstatte den. Den gemte værdi kan ikke "
"vises."

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"Entered once, stored encrypted, and cannot be viewed again. Leave empty to "
"use OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."
msgstr ""
"Indtastes én gang, gemmes krypteret og kan ikke vises igen. Lad feltet "
"være tomt for at bruge OPENROUTER_API_KEY / settings.OPENROUTER['API_KEY']."

#: admin.py:216
msgid "API key status"
